@startuml 发布优惠券顺序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 80
skinparam participantBackgroundColor white
skinparam actorBackgroundColor white
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultWidth 400
skinparam sequenceArrowColor Black
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantPadding 40


actor "运营" as Operator
participant "Coupons.vue" as Frontend
participant "CouponController" as Controller
participant "数据库" as Database

Operator -> Frontend++: 点击"发布优惠券",填写优惠券信息
Frontend -> Controller++: POST /api/coupons
Controller -> Controller: 根据用户身份区分平台券/商家券
Controller -> Controller: 校验使用范围规则
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO coupons
Database --> Controller--: 返回优惠券ID
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO coupon_products(指定服装关联)
Database --> Controller--: 返回插入结果
Controller --> Frontend--: 返回创建成功(优惠券ID)
Frontend --> Operator--: 显示发布成功提示


@enduml
